u's official briefing records implementation of the ten measures and immediate relaxation of testing, code-checking and quarantine rules.", "fast_node_id": "fast-event-04-M04", "first_public_at": "2022-12-08T10:05:00+08:00", "node_action": "OBSERVES", "occurred_at": "2022-12-07", "phase": "ESCALATION"}, {"fact": "China announced on 26–27 December 2022 it would reclassify COVID-19 to Class B and, from 8 January 2023, cancel universal nucleic-acid testing for inbound arrivals — the formal exit from zero-COVID.", "fast_node_id": "fast-event-04-M05", "first_public_at": "2022-12-27T00:00:00+08:00", "node_action": "AMPLIFIES", "occurred_at": "2023-01-08T00:00:00+08:00", "phase": "POLICY_RESPONSE"}]}, "prediction_cutoff_at": "2022-12-10T23:59:59.999999Z", "prediction_cutoff_date": "2022-12-10", "prediction_cutoff_policy": "ANCHOR_PUBLICATION_PLUS_72H_DATE_VALUES_USE_END_OF_DAY_UPPER_BOUND", "public_input": {"allowed_channel_vocabulary": ["CHINA_REOPENING", "GLOBAL_DEMAND", "RISK_APPETITE"], "evidence_documents": [{"event_id": "event-04", "evidence_packet_id": "event-04-evidence-01", "first_public_at": "2022-12-07", "first_public_at_precision": "DATE", "locator": "article body, paragraph after the Xinhua dateline", "public_source_id": "pubsrc-23d0ac147b63491959be", "publication_time_basis": "NODE_FIRST_PUBLIC_AT_WITH_EVIDENCE_LOCATOR", "publisher": "State Council of China", "quote": "国务院联防联控机制综合组7日公布《关于进一步优化落实新冠肺炎疫情防控措施的通知》，对风险区划定和管理、核酸检测、隔离方式等工作提出十个方面进一步的优化要求。", "source_tier": "A", "url": "https://www.gov.cn/xinwen/2022-12/08/content_5730637.htm", "visibility": "PUBLIC_PREDICTION"}, {"event_id": "event-04", "evidence_packet_id": "event-04-evidence-02", "first_public_at": "2022-12-08T10:05:00+08:00", "first_public_at_precision": "MINUTE", "locator": "article body, section '广州坚决贯彻落实新十条要求'", "public_source_id": "pubsrc-e0aa1029719542900ed6", "publication_time_basis": "NODE_FIRST_PUBLIC_AT_WITH_EVIDENCE_LOCATOR", "publisher": "Guangzhou Municipal Government", "quote": "12月7日，国务院联防联控机制公布了《关于进一步优化落实新冠肺炎疫情防控措施的通知》，广州市将坚决贯彻落实“新十条”要求，持续全面优化各项防控措施，更加科学精准防控疫情。", "source_tier": "A", "url": "https://www.gz.gov.cn/xw/xwfbh/content/post_8700455.html", "visibility": "PUBLIC_PREDICTION"}]}, "tasks": ["TIMELINE_RECONSTRUCTION", "GRAPH_CONSTRUCTION", "DIRECTION_AND_REFUSAL"]}
